back to life.


00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:11.598
You're a blessing.


00:04:13.252 --> 00:04:15.123
No one's ever
taken care of me before.


00:04:20.999 --> 00:04:22.043
I'll, uh...


00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:25.525
Mr. Clay...


00:04:28.963 --> 00:04:31.009
