- Boss.


00:05:40.687 --> 00:05:42.167
- MAN: You got something, yeah?
- I got one.


00:05:42.167 --> 00:05:44.082
- [INDISTINCT CHATTER]
- I want it. I need it.


00:05:44.082 --> 00:05:45.562
Hey, put it in my ear.


00:05:45.562 --> 00:05:48.391
Get this fucking
hippie shit down, please.


00:05:48.391 --> 00:05:50.088
- [COMPUTER BEEPS]
- [LINE CONNECTS]


00:05:50.088 --> 00:05:52.264
United Data Group.
Good afternoon. This is Boyd.


00:05:52.264 --> 00:05:53.308
How may I help you?


00:05:53.787 --> 00:05:55.180
Boyd.


00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:57.400
Uh, hello.
I just got a message saying


00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:59.402
