with my computer.


00:05:59.402 --> 00:06:01.186
<i>Don't you worry.
The message you received</i>


00:06:01.186 --> 00:06:03.406
<i>is from our United Data Group
antivirus software.</i>


00:06:03.406 --> 00:06:04.972
<i>It's part of
the software package</i>


00:06:04.972 --> 00:06:06.104
<i>that you pre-installed
on your computer.</i>


00:06:06.713 --> 00:06:08.759
I'm sorry.
I'm not a computer person.


00:06:08.759 --> 00:06:10.761
What did you say the name
of your product is again?


00:06:11.675 --> 00:06:13.720
[BEES BUZZING]


00:06:17.594 --> 00:06:20.205
Now, our records show
that you actually


00:06:20.205 --> 00:06:22.076
have an older version
on your account.


00:06:22.076 --> 00:06:24.688
So what I'm going to need you
to do is uninstall that


00:06:24.688 --> 00:06:26.472
<i>and install
the latest version.</i>


00:06:26.472 --> 00:06:28.387
Well, I have no idea
how to do that.


00:06:28.387 --> 00:06:29.954
My daughter set up
everything for me.


00:06:29.954 --> 00:06:31.564
<i>Well, I would recommend</i>


00:06:31.564 --> 00:06:32.913
<i>you take your computer
to an IT specialist.</i>


00:06:32.913 --> 00:06:34.480
However, keep in mind


00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:36.482
that you will lose
all your data,


00:06:36.482 --> 00:06:38.745
since they'll have to replace
the hard drive.


00:06:40.181 --> 00:06:41.531
I'm pretty remote out here.


00:06:43.794 --> 00:06:45.535
Everything I have
is on the computer.


00:06:45.535 --> 00:06:47.145
<i>Okay. There is actually</i>


00:06:47.145 --> 00:06:48.886
<i>a software package
that you can download</i>


00:06:48.886 --> 00:06:51.192
that would allow me
to reinstall remotely.


00:06:51.192 --> 00:06:54.195
All right. [SIGHS]
Tell me what to do.


00:06:54.674 --> 00:06:57.068
It's okay. Can you, uh,
can you type this,


00:06:57.068 --> 00:07:00.114
Friendly friend dot net?


00:07:00.114 --> 00:07:02.203
<i>Spelled just how it sounds.</i>


00:07:02.203 --> 00:07:03.814
[KEYBOARD CLACKING]


00:07:03.814 --> 00:07:05.076
Okay. I'm there.


00:07:05.076 --> 00:07:06.512
And there should be a button


00:07:06.512 --> 00:07:07.600
on your screen
that says "install."


00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:08.949
<i>Can you click on that button?</i>


00:07:08.949 --> 00:07:10.821
- [MOUSE CLICKS]
- I clicked the button.


00:07:10.821 --> 00:07:12.083
So you're about
to see some windows


00:07:12.083 --> 00:07:13.563
open, close on your desktop,


00:07:13.563 --> 00:07:15.652
<i>as I reinstall
the virus shield for you.</i>


00:07:15.652 --> 00:07:17.088
[LINE MUTES]


00:07:17.523 --> 00:07:18.698
Okay.


00:07:19.046 --> 00:07:20.787
I hope you fucking clowns
are paying attention.


00:07:20.787 --> 00:07:22.006
You stick to the script,


00:07:22.485 --> 00:07:26.663
but not so much that you sound
like a goddamn robot.


00:07:26.663 --> 00:07:27.881
- All right?
- [BOYD LAUGHS]


00:07:27.881 --> 00:07:30.580
BOYD: She has got
10K checking,


00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:33.496
life insurance annuity,
Roth IRA,


00:07:33.496 --> 00:07:34.758
teacher's pension and...


00:07:34.758 --> 00:07:37.369
Holy fucking shit!


00:07:37.369 --> 00:07:39.197
- [SCATTERED LAUGHS]
- [CHUCKLING] All right.


00:07:39.197 --> 00:07:41.329
She is a signatory


00:07:41.329 --> 00:07:44.376
