account.


00:07:44.376 --> 00:07:47.510
Some, uh...
It's some fucking charity.


00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:50.904
All right, kids,
let the strip mining begin.


00:07:50.904 --> 00:07:53.124
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]


00:07:53.124 --> 00:07:54.691
Ooh.
My computer's going crazy.


00:07:54.691 --> 00:07:56.562
