00:07:58.477 --> 00:07:59.870
[BEES BUZZING]


00:08:05.049 --> 00:08:06.572
Because of this inconvenience,


00:08:06.572 --> 00:08:08.052
I'm going to credit back
your subscription fees.


00:08:08.052 --> 00:08:09.227
How about that?


00:08:09.227 --> 00:08:11.403
I've gone ahead
and deposited $500


00:08:11.403 --> 00:08:13.318
