00:16:18.585 --> 00:16:21.110
I tried to stay in her life
as much as I could.


00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:22.633
Obviously, I could have
done a better job.


00:16:25.853 --> 00:16:27.420
Being old
can be a lonely thing.


00:16:29.379 --> 00:16:33.035
Turn a certain age, you cease
to exist. Cease to matter.


00:16:33.687 --> 00:16:36.473
Used to be a part of life,
of the family.


00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:39.258
Part of the hive,
I guess you could say.


00:16:41.652 --> 00:16:43.958
There's some British Isles
hiding in your accent.


00:16:46.744 --> 00:16:47.919
I was born there.


00:16:50.835 --> 00:16:52.793
I hated that she was
out here alone.


00:16:54.665 --> 00:16:55.840
