She loved him.


00:17:20.125 --> 00:17:21.648
He'd mow the lawn


00:17:21.648 --> 00:17:24.608
and you'd think
he invented fire. [CHUCKLES]


00:17:24.608 --> 00:17:26.610
You know, while I graduated
the FBI Academy


00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:28.786
and she said,
"Oh, that's nice."


00:17:31.919 --> 00:17:33.051
She got scammed.


00:17:34.922 --> 00:17:37.011
Somebody emptied out
all her accounts,


00:17:37.969 --> 00:17:39.797
