out of that account.


00:17:51.896 --> 00:17:53.680
- You know who did it?
- [SIGHS]


00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:55.465
I talked to an agent
in our cyber-crimes office.


00:17:56.205 --> 00:17:57.728
This crew's been operating
for two years


00:17:57.728 --> 00:17:59.033
