01:30:01.221 --> 01:30:02.265
- Yeah.
- Go.


01:30:03.092 --> 01:30:04.790
[GROANING]


01:30:04.790 --> 01:30:06.487
Get off me! [GRUNTS]


01:30:07.880 --> 01:30:09.359
He's fucking mine!


01:30:10.273 --> 01:30:12.101
Talk to me, people.
I need news.


01:30:12.101 --> 01:30:13.538
[INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING]


01:30:21.415 --> 01:30:22.590
AGENT: He's here!


01:30:22.590 --> 01:30:24.418
AGENT 2: Go! Go! All stations!


01:30:25.158 --> 01:30:27.334
[INDISTINCT SHOUTING]


01:30:27.334 --> 01:30:29.510
Take it easy. Take it easy.


01:30:29.510 --> 01:30:30.816
[INDISTINCT RADIO CHATTER]


01:30:31.338 --> 01:30:33.383
- [GRUNTING]
- [INDISTINCT SHOUTING]


01:30:33.993 --> 01:30:35.211
Go with the flow.


01:30:35.211 --> 01:30:36.691
AGENT 3: Not clear.
He's not clear.


01:30:36.691 --> 01:30:37.953
- AGENT 4: Hang tight.
- [AGENT 5 GRUNTING]


01:30:37.953 --> 01:30:39.172
On me.


01:30:41.740 --> 01:30:42.871
[GUNSHOTS]


01:30:42.871 --> 01:30:44.656
[GUESTS PANICKING]


01:30:45.178 --> 01:30:47.093
[GRUNTING]


01:30:52.881 --> 01:30:53.926
[MERCENARY GROANING IN PAIN]


01:30:59.105 --> 01:31:01.281
AGENT 6: Get on the ground.
Get on the ground.


01:31:01.890 --> 01:31:04.066
- [GUNSHOTS IN DISTANCE]
- [INDISTINCT SHOUTING]


01:31:04.066 --> 01:31:06.504
You understand you did this, right?


01:31:06.504 --> 01:31:07.853
You broke the rules.


01:31:08.375 --> 01:31:10.203
You corrupted an imperfect
but functioning system.


01:31:10.203 --> 01:31:12.292
I was just trying
to get you into office, Mom.


01:31:12.292 --> 01:31:13.815
How else do you think
you got elected?


01:31:13.815 --> 01:31:15.513
I was going to win
with or without your help.


01:31:16.078 --> 01:31:19.386
We were already rich.
Your father built an empire.


01:31:19.386 --> 01:31:20.996
Yeah. And you were going
to fucking


01:31:20.996 --> 01:31:22.868
break it up into pieces
and sell it off.


01:31:22.868 --> 01:31:24.347
Well, in the name
of public service


01:31:24.347 --> 01:31:27.002
because I care and I want
to leave a better world.


01:31:27.002 --> 01:31:28.177
Okay. Right.


01:31:28.177 --> 01:31:29.918
Yeah, because
you hate the fact


01:31:29.918 --> 01:31:31.311
that being the president


01:31:31.311 --> 01:31:32.834
is just like
an endless cocktail party.


01:31:32.834 --> 01:31:34.227
You realize
that you were behind


01:31:34.227 --> 01:31:36.011
in 15 of 20 counties
you needed to win.


01:31:36.011 --> 01:31:37.665
15 of 20 counties!


01:31:37.665 --> 01:31:40.668
I taught CIA software
to hunt money


01:31:40.668 --> 01:31:41.930
and not terrorists.


01:31:43.541 --> 01:31:44.846
You didn't hear that.


01:31:45.412 --> 01:31:47.632
[INDISTINCT SHOUTING]


01:31:50.330 --> 01:31:51.766
[GRUNTING]


01:31:58.381 --> 01:32:00.340
You got elected because of me,
and you know that.


01:32:00.340 --> 01:32:02.734
Yeah, I know it.
Everyone knows it.


01:32:02.734 --> 01:32:04.170
Now I know
where the money came from...


01:32:04.170 --> 01:32:05.258
[SNORTS, SNIFFS]


01:32:05.258 --> 01:32:06.651
...and all the people
you hurt.


01:32:06.651 --> 01:32:08.566
Okay, whatever.
It's computer data, Mom.


01:32:08.566 --> 01:32:10.568
Somebody in this family has
to have their fucking feet


01:32:10.568 --> 01:32:12.613
on the ground to actually get
shit done. You understand that?


01:32:12.613 --> 01:32:14.093
[ALL GRUNTING]


01:32:25.539 --> 01:32:26.453
[SCREAMS]


01:32:28.629 --> 01:32:32.590
Mom, the wolves are
at the fucking door right now.


01:32:33.155 --> 01:32:34.635
What are you going to do
to fix this?


01:32:38.421 --> 01:32:39.466
Tell the truth.


01:32:41.555 --> 01:32:42.861
The fucking...


01:32:42.861 --> 01:32:44.689
[STUTTERS]
What does that even mean?


01:32:44.689 --> 01:32:46.734
What does that even mean,
tell the fucking truth?


01:32:46.734 --> 01:32:47.996
- [SCOFFS]
- You have an entire building


01:32:47.996 --> 01:32:49.476
full of PR people


01:32:49.476 --> 01:32:51.347
that are going to choose
the right way forward.


01:32:51.347 --> 01:32:53.219
That guy who's coming
to kill us, that Beekeeper,


01:32:53.219 --> 01:32:56.091
I'm telling him the truth
about what you did, Derek.


01:32:56.091 --> 01:32:57.789
Then I'm telling
the entire nation.


01:32:57.789 --> 01:32:59.660
And if it costs me everything,


01:33:00.052 --> 01:33:01.531
well, so be it.


01:33:02.924 --> 01:33:04.491
[GUESTS PANICKING]


01:33:16.329 --> 01:33:17.591
[GRUNTING]


01:33:41.267 --> 01:33:42.660
[GRUNTING]


01:33:46.620 --> 01:33:48.317
[SCREAMS, GRUNTS]


01:33:50.842 --> 01:33:52.321
[KNUCKLES CRACKING]


01:34:03.637 --> 01:34:05.683
[BOTH GRUNTING]


01:34:10.557 --> 01:34:11.689
[LAZARUS YELLS]


01:34:15.127 --> 01:34:16.432
You fucking git!


01:34:20.001 --> 01:34:20.872
[STABS GLASS]


01:34:22.656 --> 01:34:23.657
Fuck!


01:34:28.706 --> 01:34:30.185
You're just a man.


01:34:30.751 --> 01:34:32.100
I know.


01:34:32.100 --> 01:34:33.885
[GRUNTING]


01:34:58.474 --> 01:35:00.520
[BOTH GRUNTING]


01:35:25.153 --> 01:35:27.286
- Thank you.
- [GRUNTING]


01:35:47.001 --> 01:35:48.655
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]


01:35:52.964 --> 01:35:54.400
[METAL CLANGS]


01:36:02.495 --> 01:36:04.845
Jesus. Looks like
a tornado came through here.


01:36:10.720 --> 01:36:12.113
[STUTTERS]
What's your plan here, huh?


01:36:12.113 --> 01:36:13.636
You're going to tell this guy
the fucking truth


01:36:13.636 --> 01:36:15.377
and hope that he spares you
and kills me instead?


01:36:15.377 --> 01:36:16.639
No, Derek,
I'll tell him the truth


01:36:16.639 --> 01:36:17.771
because it's the truth.


01:36:23.472 --> 01:36:25.518
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:36:27.912 --> 01:36:30.044
It's gone far enough.
You've proved your point.


01:36:31.132 --> 01:36:33.352
Beekeepers live
for the good of society.


01:36:35.006 --> 01:36:36.137
I'm retired.


01:36:37.443 --> 01:36:38.705
This is personal.


01:36:39.837 --> 01:36:41.229
All the more reason to stop.


01:36:42.970 --> 01:36:45.233
Go back. Live a quiet life.


01:36:45.973 --> 01:36:47.627
Making honey
for your neighbors.


01:36:48.106 --> 01:36:49.324
That's all I wanted.


01:36:50.543 --> 01:36:53.372
- My neighbor's dead.
- I know. I'm sorry.


01:36:53.372 --> 01:36:55.896
But do you live
in the real world


01:36:55.896 --> 01:36:57.550
or just protect it?


01:37:00.945 --> 01:37:02.250
What does it matter to you


01:37:02.250 --> 01:37:04.905
how presidents
come to be elected?


01:37:04.905 --> 01:37:07.125
- Hm?
- It doesn't.


01:37:07.734 --> 01:37:09.301
What does matter to you?


01:37:10.171 --> 01:37:11.216
Right and wrong.


01:37:12.391 --> 01:37:13.609
It's not fashionable.


01:37:14.872 --> 01:37:16.438
I believe there's good
in the universe.


01:37:16.438 --> 01:37:20.616
Yeah, well, we agree.
I mean, that's my view.


01:37:21.879 --> 01:37:23.881
Until the Danforth family
bought you.


01:37:24.446 --> 01:37:26.274
- Ah.
- You can stop pretending.


01:37:27.623 --> 01:37:30.061
We wouldn't need Beekeepers
if it wasn't for men like you.


01:37:30.670 --> 01:37:32.150
- WALLACE: Don't do that.
- [BEEPING]


01:37:32.150 --> 01:37:33.368
Sir, you might want
to step back.


01:37:33.368 --> 01:37:34.674
No.


01:37:35.109 --> 01:37:37.285
- I don't want you to get hurt.
- I'm sorry. I can't do that.


01:37:37.285 --> 01:37:38.373
- [BONES CRACK]
- [GROANING]


01:37:38.983 --> 01:37:40.114
Now, have a seat.


01:37:41.159 --> 01:37:43.422
[GROANING IN PAIN]


01:37:44.336 --> 01:37:47.600
Nah, fuck the truth, man.
The truth...


01:37:47.600 --> 01:37:48.949
- Wait. You put that down.
- No, Derek.


01:37:48.949 --> 01:37:50.298
...comes out
of your fucking...


01:37:51.647 --> 01:37:52.910
Jesus Christ!


01:37:52.910 --> 01:37:54.085
That's fucking real
right there.


01:37:54.085 --> 01:37:55.738
- [EXPLOSION]
- [DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]


01:38:02.136 --> 01:38:04.182
[DEREK BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:38:04.182 --> 01:38:06.053
[JESSICA BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:38:06.053 --> 01:38:07.228
