01:38:21.982 --> 01:38:22.940
[EXHALES]


01:38:25.551 --> 01:38:27.248
You decide who you work for.


01:38:29.598 --> 01:38:30.686
For the law


01:38:32.471 --> 01:38:33.951
or for justice.


01:38:35.169 --> 01:38:36.388
[JESSICA WHIMPERING]


01:38:37.128 --> 01:38:38.216
Fuck this.


01:38:38.651 --> 01:38:39.521
Bye, Mom.


01:38:46.224 --> 01:38:48.052
SWAT 1: Go! Go!
SWAT 2: Move. Move.


01:38:48.052 --> 01:38:49.879
- Move it out. Out of the way.
- WILEY: You're okay.


01:38:49.879 --> 01:38:52.926
- I got you. I got you.
- No. No. I want my...


01:38:54.406 --> 01:38:55.450
Clay!


01:38:58.932 --> 01:39:00.064
AGENT: Come with us right now!


01:39:01.108 --> 01:39:04.242
- No! I want my... I want my...
- Back away. Back away.


01:39:04.242 --> 01:39:05.765
No!


01:39:05.765 --> 01:39:07.419
AGENT 2: You need to come
with me. Come on.


01:39:07.419 --> 01:39:09.116
- No!
- Move out. Move out.


01:39:10.204 --> 01:39:12.424
- Give me your hand. Come on!
- JESSICA: No!


01:39:12.424 --> 01:39:13.903
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]


01:39:25.393 --> 01:39:26.873
Goodbye, Adam Clay.


01:39:27.700 --> 01:39:30.007
- Keep eyes on! Let's go!
- [INDISTINCT RADIO CHATTER]


01:39:31.399 --> 01:39:33.401
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]


01:40:12.092 --> 01:40:13.180
[BEES BUZZING]


01:40:13.180 --> 01:40:14.790
